he three exhibition rooms presents traditional art such as masks, bronze and woodwork.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_palais_des_sports_de_warda","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Palais des Sports de Warda","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":3.87397,"lng":11.51204},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_palais_des_sports_de_warda","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["palaisdessportsdewarda","yaounde"],"summary":"A Chinese-built indoor arena, this is a venue for both team and individual sports from basketball to judo. It is also used for exhibitions, conferences and such events, moreover the building itself is a good example of futuristic architecture.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_statue_of_charles_atangana","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Statue of Charles Atangana","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":3.8588,"lng":11.52019},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_statue_of_charles_atangana","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["statueofcharlesatangana","yaounde"],"summary":"Memorial to an important Cameroonian historical figure who was the chief of Ewondo and Bane peoples and served diplomatically as an administrator with the German and French colonial powers for the betterment of the people. In a very noisy traffic triangle.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_eco_park","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Eco Park","category":"park","tags":["nature","photo"],"location":{"lat":3.78679,"lng":11.48799},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_eco_park","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://ecopark.cm/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["ecopark",