e Meuomi Palace Hotel) take the first left. Given that it's popular, it can sometimes be hard to find a table.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_le_rondo","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Le Rondo","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":3.9126,"lng":11.496},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_le_rondo","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.hotel-montfebe.com/restaurants/le-rondo/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lerondo","yaounde"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Upscale restaurant with superb views of the city. At lunchtime there is a buffet, other times you can choose something from the menu (dishes around FCFA 6800). As it's a bit outside the city, it can be hard to get a taxi to get back; most customers have their own car.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_le_cafe_de_yaounde","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Le Café de Yaoundé","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":3.8728,"lng":11.5188},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_le_cafe_de_yaounde","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/cafedefranceyaounde","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lecafedeyaounde","yaounde"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Pricey (~10 000 for your meal) food. Seems to be catering to the expat crowd with a focus on European style cuisine. Nice ambiance with patio seating in a lush garden area.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_l_orient_rouge","areaId":"yaounde","name":"L'orient Rouge","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":3.89468,"lng":11.50727},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_l_orient_rouge","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lorientrouge","yaounde"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Chinese restaurant, also popular with the Chinese community in Yaoundé. Reportedly beautifully decorated, good food and friendly and attentive staff.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_panoramique_bar","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Panoramique bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":3.86463,"lng":11.51567},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"yaounde_wv_panoramique_bar","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www3.hilton.com/en/hotels/cameroon/hilton-yaounde-YAOHITW/index.html","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["panoramiquebar","yaounde"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Nice bar on top of the Hilton hotel. One of the few places where you can listen to music when having a drink. Happy hour every afternoon.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Yaoundé"},{"id":"yaounde_wv_le_moulin_de_france","areaId":"yaounde","name":"Le moulin de France","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{